### 1. Login as an ARTIST
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "artist@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "artiste"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("artistAccessToken", response.body.token.accessToken);
%}


### 3. Artist requests a transfer to another gallery (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artists/request-transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{artistAccessToken}}

{
  "newGalleryId": "{{targetGalleryUserId}}",
  "reason": "Looking for a gallery specialized in contemporary art."
}


### 4. Request a transfer again while one is PENDING (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artists/request-transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{artistAccessToken}}

{
  "newGalleryId": "{{targetGalleryUserId}}",
  "reason": "Second attempt while the first is still pending."
}


### 5. Request a transfer to a NON-EXISTENT gallery (404 Not Found)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artists/request-transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{artistAccessToken}}

{
  "newGalleryId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999",
  "reason": "Transfer to a gallery that does not exist."
}


### 6. Request a transfer with an INVALID body (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artists/request-transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{artistAccessToken}}

{
  "newGalleryId": "not-a-uuid"
}
